                                                "sense_id": "7ec721c9-5c05-31bd-8748-753956ca6687",
                                                "text": "Clickjacking, however, evades the need for this cross domain reading, and instead directly places the mouse over the target area to click on the link or form that contains the nonce - thereby bypassing the need for client side cross domain read exploitation."
